  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "A documentary filmmaker named James Fox has looked into a 1996 case in the Brazilian town of Varginha, where people say a strange creature was caught, and he talks about a doctor named Cesario who treated Marco Chereze, a police officer said to have handled the creature before falling ill. According to Fox, Cesario said he threw everything he had at the infection, and that the antibiotics should have saved Chereze's life but did nothing at all. If true, it would suggest the officer caught something no ordinary medicine could touch."
